{"articleNo":"490457","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=490457&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[부속기관] [KAIST IDEC]시스템반도체설계실무인력양성 교육 7기 교육생 모집","writer":"디스플레이연구소","writeDate":"2024.06.18","hit":"6202","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/cms/plugin/editorImage.do?EwBmBYHoQNkgteAhAbgQRQaQCIA0DOaAHgCYBeA6gJYDyAngEYAWAdAFYAOA5kA%20\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"clear:none;float:none;\"></p><p><br></p><h4 style=\"line-height: 24px;\"><font color=\"#424242\" face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">【제7기 교육 개요】</span></font></h4><h4 style=\"line-height: 24px;\"><font color=\"#424242\" face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><br></span></font></h4><h4 style=\"line-height: 24px;\"><font color=\"#424242\" face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">○ 교육 목적: 시스템반도체 분야 산업경쟁력 강화를 위한 사업계 맞춤형 교육과정 운영 및 반도체 설계 실무인력 양성</span></font></h4><h4 style=\"line-height: 24px;\"><font color=\"#424242\" face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">○ 교육 기간: 2024. 9. 2. ~ 12. 20. (4개월 과정)</span></font></h4><h4 style=\"line-height: 24px;\"><font color=\"#424242\" face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">○ 교육 장소: KAIST IDEC 동탄교육장 (롯데백화점 동탄점 내)</span></font></h4><h4 style=\"line-height: 24px;\"><font color=\"#424242\" face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">○ 교육 대상: 아래 조건을 모두 충족하는 경우 교육 대상에 포함</span></font></h4><h4 style=\"line-height: 24px;\"><font color=\"#424242\" face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp; 1) 반도체 분야 취업을 희망하는 학부 졸업(예정)자인 분 (전공자, 비전공자 모두 포함)</span></font></h4><h4 style=\"line-height: 24px;\"><font color=\"#424242\" face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp; 2) 취업에 결격사유가 없는 분</span></font></h4><h4 style=\"line-height: 24px;\"><font color=\"#424242\" face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">○ 수강 혜택</span></font></h4><h4 style=\"line-height: 24px;\"><font color=\"#424242\" face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp; 1) 교육비 전액 지원</span></font></h4><h4 style=\"line-height: 24px;\"><font color=\"#424242\" face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp; 2) 교육지원금 지급 (요건 충족 시)</span></font></h4><h4 style=\"line-height: 24px;\"><font color=\"#424242\" face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp; 3) 협력 기업 소개 및 취업 기회 제공</span></font></h4><h4 style=\"line-height: 24px;\"><font color=\"#424242\" face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"><b><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">○ 신청 기간: 2024. 7. 1.(월) ~ 7. 12.(금)</span></b></span></font></h4><h4 style=\"line-height: 24px;\"><font color=\"#424242\" face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">○ 교육 신청 방법: 온라인 신청 (https://academy.idec.or.kr/track/apply/list/)</span></font></h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
